1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,685
Radeon Hotel is a private journey agent for Track Two,
built for AMD Radeon and ROCm.

2
00:00:04,878 --> 00:00:11,375
It plans, quotes, confirms, recovers disruptions, protects
memory, and leaves an auditable stay outcome.

3
00:00:11,568 --> 00:00:15,622
Core inference stays local, while every consequential
action remains reversible.

4
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:22,965
Hotel trips combine policy, live inventory, prices,
personal needs, and actions with real consequences.

5
00:00:23,158 --> 00:00:27,517
A late flight can invalidate a room or transfer preview
after part of the journey is confirmed.

6
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:31,519
Radeon Hotel preserves completed work and recomputes only
unsettled state.

7
00:00:31,712 --> 00:00:35,765
Allergy handling is escalated to trained staff instead of
being falsely automated.

8
00:00:35,958 --> 00:00:40,378
This creates one coordinated workflow, not a collection of
disconnected chat answers.

9
00:00:41,387 --> 00:00:45,685
This is the live public interface running the optimized C
profile on the Radeon target.

10
00:00:45,878 --> 00:00:50,440
The request combines future dates, a standard room, a
child, and a late arrival.

11
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:54,727
It also requests allergy handling, a quiet room, and
airport transfer.

12
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:59,585
The agent must cite policy, check live availability, and
calculate an exact quote.

13
00:00:59,778 --> 00:01:04,116
The guest explicitly asks for preview only, so no
reservation write may occur yet.

14
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:08,180
The local model selects evidence and proposes a bounded
plan.

15
00:01:08,373 --> 00:01:13,078
Deterministic tools own live inventory, price, and every
consequential state transition.

16
00:01:13,271 --> 00:01:16,042
The captured result reports eight standard rooms
available.

17
00:01:16,235 --> 00:01:19,331
The authoritative two-night total is two hundred
fifty-eight yuan.

18
00:01:19,524 --> 00:01:23,597
Only one safe action is exposed: confirm or cancel the
displayed room hold.

19
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:28,190
Confirmed writes remain zero; this is a real preview, not
a simulated completion.

20
00:01:29,199 --> 00:01:32,580
The model proposes, but a deterministic control plane
decides.

21
00:01:32,773 --> 00:01:37,804
Schema validation checks tool allow-lists, arguments,
dependencies, and citations.

22
00:01:37,997 --> 00:01:40,686
It also checks Journey State and every write precondition.

23
00:01:40,878 --> 00:01:44,973
Local policy RAG and thirteen typed tools run beside Qwen
through llama.cpp.

24
00:01:45,166 --> 00:01:50,298
SQLite stores minimized journey state and HMAC-linked
audit records, not raw chat history.

25
00:01:50,491 --> 00:01:56,032
No remote inference API, arbitrary shell, network, or SQL
tool sits inside the core agent.

26
00:01:57,040 --> 00:02:00,483
All five Track Two capabilities share one authoritative
Journey State.

27
00:02:00,676 --> 00:02:04,342
Local RAG returns stable chunk identifiers and citation
support.

28
00:02:04,535 --> 00:02:08,263
Typed tools and multi-step plans remain bounded by
server-side validation.

29
00:02:08,456 --> 00:02:13,038
Memory is owner-scoped, off by default, and saved only
after explicit consent.

30
00:02:13,231 --> 00:02:18,120
Identity isolation and injection partitioning block
cross-user disclosure and unsafe execution.

31
00:02:19,129 --> 00:02:24,017
The judge path begins with policy, availability, exact
quote, and a room-hold preview.

32
00:02:24,210 --> 00:02:29,160
After independent confirmation, booking evidence can
support a separately previewed airport transfer.

33
00:02:29,353 --> 00:02:33,304
Delay recovery recalculates the stay change and transfer
update independently.

34
00:02:33,497 --> 00:02:35,310
Already confirmed work is preserved.

35
00:02:35,503 --> 00:02:38,395
Only stale or unsettled actions require a fresh preview.

36
00:02:38,588 --> 00:02:44,047
Memory consent, one preference, privacy proof, and a staff
safety handoff complete the journey.

37
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:48,701
A Final Stay Brief appears only after required business
actions are settled and revalidated.

38
00:02:49,710 --> 00:02:53,070
Trust is enforced outside the model, not requested through
a prompt.

39
00:02:53,263 --> 00:02:58,763
Every write uses one preview, one action identifier, and
one server-held confirmation capability.

40
00:02:58,956 --> 00:03:04,496
For mixed-scope injection, the server isolates the
untrusted note before retrieval, inference, or tools.

41
00:03:04,689 --> 00:03:08,213
The legitimate owner read can continue while the unsafe
scope is refused.

42
00:03:08,406 --> 00:03:12,113
Privacy Proof records zero domain writes and zero
cross-user results.

43
00:03:12,306 --> 00:03:15,402
It also proves no retained secret and a verified audit
chain.

44
00:03:16,411 --> 00:03:20,709
Core inference is bound to one live Radeon process and one
declared request profile.

45
00:03:20,901 --> 00:03:25,444
The measured environment uses ROCm seven point two point
one on gfx eleven hundred.

46
00:03:25,637 --> 00:03:27,959
The target reports ninety-six compute units.

47
00:03:28,152 --> 00:03:30,922
llama.cpp offloads all forty-one model layers.

48
00:03:31,115 --> 00:03:34,802
Both comparison runs reached one hundred percent peak GPU
activity.

49
00:03:34,995 --> 00:03:40,677
Process, model, binary, configuration, and evidence
digests are checked for each bound request.

50
00:03:40,870 --> 00:03:45,392
No retail board name is invented; the proof reports the
identity exposed by the target.

51
00:03:46,401 --> 00:03:49,741
The final optimization claim is a controlled B-to-C
comparison.

52
00:03:49,934 --> 00:03:53,356
Only Flash Attention changes between the reference and
optimized runs.

53
00:03:53,549 --> 00:04:01,615
Model, source, corpus, workload, prompts, context, batch,
cache, parallelism, and physical GPU remain fixed.

54
00:04:01,808 --> 00:04:06,208
Both runs complete sixteen of sixteen requests, with zero
model-call failures.

55
00:04:06,401 --> 00:04:09,986
Both retain the same fifteen-of-sixteen citation-section
projection.

56
00:04:10,179 --> 00:04:14,436
Flash Attention raises concurrency-four throughput by six
point four nine one percent.

57
00:04:14,629 --> 00:04:18,947
It lowers concurrency-four P ninety-five latency by five
point four two eight percent.

58
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:22,419
Median decode rate improves by twelve point nine eight one
percent.

59
00:04:22,612 --> 00:04:25,423
Peak VRAM drops from fifty-eight to fifty-seven percent.

60
00:04:25,616 --> 00:04:27,755
The comparator accepts C as optimized.

61
00:04:27,948 --> 00:04:32,551
We do not claim three hundred of three hundred, full
A-to-H, stability, or soak.

62
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:38,061
Radeon Hotel combines local intelligence with
deterministic authority and reversible writes.

63
00:04:38,254 --> 00:04:43,550
It adds consented memory, grounded answers, identity
isolation, and hash-bound Radeon proof.

64
00:04:43,743 --> 00:04:49,935
Judges can inspect the live C profile, frozen source,
English deck, this video, and reviewed comparison.

65
00:04:50,128 --> 00:04:53,306
It is designed to stay safe when reality changes after
preview.
